('Interval run 4x4','interval-run-4x4','endurance','{cardiovascular,legs}','{none}','advanced','home','{}',4,NULL,240,180,'{"Warm up 10 minutes easy.","Run 4 minutes at a hard but sustainable effort (RPE 8).","Recover 3 minutes easy. Repeat 4 times.","Cool down 5-10 minutes."}','{"Only add intervals once you have a base of easy aerobic work.","Cap hard sessions at 2 per week for most people."}','{"Uncontrolled cardiovascular disease","Acute illness"}','{"Cycling intervals","Rowing intervals"}','{"Add a fifth interval"}','{"2 intervals","Reduce to 2 minutes hard"}',15,'Norwegian 4x4 protocol (Wisloff et al.)','https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/17548726/','high',true),
